# charmbracelet VHS: vhs docs/demo.tape
Output docs/assets/demo.gif
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1400
Set Height 700
Type "npx @muzaffermahi/fade --demo"
Enter
Sleep 3s
Type "add a version file"
Enter
Sleep 8s
Type "make the help text friendlier"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "the second one"
Enter
Sleep 8s
Type "yes"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "undo that"
Enter
Sleep 8s
